        "Description": "47,\r\rFive years ago, Sebastian Krogh left his sweetheart Teresa Schultz to marry her best friend, Rinnet Boyle. However, the marriage was a lie, a scheme between the couple to murder Boyle and claim her fortune.\r\rTheir plot might have been foiled by Hercule Poirot, but the famous detective drank a bad tisane  in Cairo and was unable to join their cruise along the Nile.\r\rFive years of sleuthing by Boyle&apos;s sister has revealed the truth, and the family wants their revenge on the murderous couple.",
